	Business Recommendations
	1. Improve Card Activation	
	Focus on inactive cards and encourage customers to activate them through suitable offers, reminders, and awareness campaigns.	

	2. Monitor Loan Repayments
	Pay closer attention to delayed payments and monitor repayment patterns across loan types to identify accounts that may need follow-up.

	3. Provide Segment-
	Based Banking Services Use customer segment, account activity, and balance information to offer banking products that suit different customer needs.

	4. Improve Account Engagement Monitor
	 active and closed accounts and understand differences in account balances across account types and branches to identify opportunities for better customer 
      engagement.

	5. Analyze Transaction Trends Monitor
 	monthly transaction amounts and transaction types to understand changes in customer activity and plan suitable banking services.

	6. Encourage Relevant Product Usage
	Use card types, networks, credit limits, and reward points to understand product engagement and identify opportunities to improve customer usage.
